{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-03-30 16:15:00', 'title': 'SWEP ENHANCES ALL-STAINLESS RANGE OF BRAZED PLATE HEAT EXCHANGERS WITH B222 LARGE-SIZE MODEL', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , MARCH 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SWEP, PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV), AND A WORLD-LEADING SUPPLIER OF COMPACT BRAZED PLATE HEAT EXCHANGERS (BPHES), HAS ANNOUNCED THE EXPANSION OF ITS ALL-STAINLESS RANGE BY INTRODUCING THE B222 LARGE-SIZE MODEL.'}